Revision history for Sledge
$Id: Changes,v 1.14 2004/10/29 06:10:25 miyagawa Exp $

1.12
	* Added Session::DBIFactory (auto-dispatch of Session Driver)
	* Added SessionManager::Null (Thanks to Masaki SEIKI)
	* Fixed error message by Template::TT
	- Added Encode::compat into prereq-modules (for Sledge::Charset::UTF8)
	- Fixed warnings in various test files (Added no warnings 'redefine')
	- Added no warnings 'redefine' before localizing context() in Pages::Base
	- Added ref($input) test in Tempalte::TT (hayakawa)
	  it allows $self->tmpl->set_option(file => \$body);
	- Generates dummy warnings.pm if $[ < 5.006 for no warnings thing
	* Fixed Charset::UTF8 to encode/decode only when $] >= 5.006
	* Added new hook: BEFORE_INIT (hayakawa)

1.11 Tue Feb 24 17:47:56 JST 2004
	- Fixed t/30_upload.t failing when $TMPDIR is set
	  (Thanks to Hiroyuki Kobayashi)
	- Bundle::Sledge is now on CPAN
	- Makefile.PL simplified
	- CGI 2.47 and LWP added on PREREQ_PM
	  (Thanks to Masashi Seiki)
	* [Bug Fix] SessionManager::Rewrite: save parameters on first access (hanabusa)
	- [Refactoring] move _prepare() from Session.pm to Session::DBI
	- Added DESTROY { } in Request/CGI.pm
	* Added Charset::UTF8
	* [Bug Fix] SessionManager::Rewrite: fixed bug where the query on first access was not saved (hanabusa)
	* Added Sledge::Session::File
	* Added Sledge::SessionManager::Any

1.10 Fri Feb 13 15:59:13 JST 2003
	* Open Source Release!
	- Sledge/Hammer.pm => Sledge.pm
	- Edge::Config => Sledge::Config

1.08 (Unreleased)
	* [new API] added add_filter(), filters()
	  object methods that filter the content
	* SessionManager::StickyQuery: a SessionManager that does not use mod_rewrite
	* Session: set the session ID length with $Sledge::Session::SessionIdLength
	* [Bug Fix] Session::Pg: added "SELECT ... FOR UPDATE" (toona)
	* [Bug Fix] fixed parameter parsing bug in SessionManager::StickyQuery
	* [Bug Fix] fixed bug where SessionManager::StickyQuery did not use $SessionIdName (toona)

1.07 Fri Oct 25 15:47:44 JST 2002
	* Session: added cleanup() class method
	* implemented _do_cleanup in Session::Pg (ikebe)
	* added set_content_length method that outputs Content-Length
	* [Bug Fix] Session: fixed bug where expire() did not release the LOCK (ikebe)
	- Template::TT: stop using the hook, so that config/r/session are also passed in Plugin::Mail (hanabusa)
	- SessionManager::Rewrite: put sid=$sid at the beginning of the path (dos, hideoki)
	- [Minor] Pages::Base: fixed the error when a template is not found
	- SessionManager::Rewrite: made sid= configurable ($SessionIdName variable) (dos)
	* Charset::Default: s/x-euc-jp/euc-jp/
	- removed Sledge::Pages

1.06 Tue Aug 27 21:37:12 JST 2002
	* Template::TT: set TMPL_PATH and . in INCLUDE_PATH by default
	* [developer API change]
	  added Sledge::Exceptions
	  changed all classes to use Exception
	* [implementation change]
	  changed Session::DBI connect to connect_cached when not under mod_perl
	- added Exception::DeprecatedMethod
	- made the do_redirect() method Deprecated
	* Request::CGI: added status(), which outputs the Status: header
	* [Bug Fix] fixed bug where 200 OK was output under mod_perl
	  made send_content() Deprecated and added make_content()
	- use Error.pm instead of Exception::Class
	  added Exception class (inherits from Error::Simple)
	* added Registrar class (placeholder)
	  Registrar->context returns the currently running Pages object  (hayakawa)
	- fixed so that make test also passes on perl 5.6.1 and 5.8.0
	- SessionManager: fixed typo (hanabusa)

1.05 Fri Aug 16 20:27:47 JST 2002
	- eg/sessions.sql: made a_session mediumtext
	* Install: made Template::TT the default
	* Template::TT: moved to the core directory
	* Template::TT: registers a BEFORE_DISPATCH hook by default
	  which sets r, config and session in the template

